  <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#F5F5F5] sm:text-4xl">
    Community Guidelines
  </h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
    Moview welcomes thoughtful debate about cinema and series. To keep discussions constructive for everyone, all viewer ratings and reviews must follow these rules.
  </p>

  <div class="review-prose mt-8">
    <h2>1. No Abuse, Hate Speech, or Personal Attacks</h2>
    <p>
      Critique the film, series, writing, or performances—never attack fellow commenters, cast, or creators with slurs, harassment, threats, or hate speech targeting protected characteristics.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Mark Spoilers Clearly</h2>
    <p>
      If your review reveals major plot twists, endings, cameo surprises, or character deaths, check the <strong>Contains spoilers</strong> box before posting so other readers can choose when to reveal it.
    </p>

    <h2>3. No Piracy Links or Spam</h2>
    <p>
      Never post links to pirated streams, unauthorized downloads, referral spam, or promotional solicitations. Reviews are rate-limited to prevent automated flooding.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Moderation &amp; Reporting</h2>
    <p>
      Use the <strong>Report</strong> button on any review that breaks these guidelines. Moderators review flagged entries and may hide or permanently remove offending posts.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
